  tidewalker: 'Walks the tide flats at low water and always knows when to turn back.',
  blossomkeeper: 'Tends the gardens around the eastern tower. The flowers bloom even in the fog.',
  smith: 'Forges what the other keepers break. Busy.',
  ranger: 'Watches the steppe from the frontier towers, alone for months at a time.',
  caller: 'Calls the lost home with a horn that carries for miles.',
